{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_003_title", "source_sha256": "1089dbfba48953ad5353280c1dfa76125253eda4aa35998ec04e407cc96e5ad7", "ja": "キラキラの毎日、キラキラの明日", "zh": "闪亮的每天，耀眼的明天", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_003_synopsis", "source_sha256": "2daa370bad9b04569fc87a18322b3226877c832f4fee74872c034fda9dd6b750", "ja": "次回公演のセンターに指名されたものの、気\n乗りしない様子の翼。しかし、通りかかった\n美希がセンターに立候補したことで突然やる\n気モードに。レッスンはサボりがちなまま、\nそのセンスで無事に公演を乗りきる。", "zh": "翼虽然被指定为下次公演的Center，\n却一副兴趣缺缺的样子。然而在路过的美希\n表示自己也想当Center后，翼突然变得充满\n干劲。尽管练习时常常偷懒，她仍凭借着天分\n顺利完成公演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_003_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0116f5956eda24901d7e8ffe6d576366d44814d13818cf59840d0d2385ebd482", "ja": "翼、ちょっといいか？", "zh": "翼，你有空吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_003_1001_016tsu", "source_sha256": "a47bc07a6650b776224d5b1188237e9a5c886f102537aca64098e9f2cad6b721", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さんだ～。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_003_1002_003mik", "source_sha256": "a9787a6f61d1c103cb2b8e4aefa0b62466a9ad6bfe6a1e3f503de4325886137c", "ja": "{$P$}、いいところに来たの。\n翼が、ミキのジャマするの……あふぅ。", "zh": "{$P$}，你来得正好。\n翼一直在妨碍美希唷……啊呼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_003_1003_016tsu", "source_sha256": "103d9396bb59572f48c84c0f678a6a2d1dc1b0e06f7f3fd17024fe82110bd74a", "ja": "ジャマしてないですよ～、も～。\n{$P$}さん、お疲れさまで～す。", "zh": "我才没有呢～真是的～\n{$P$}先生，辛苦了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_003_1004_p", "source_sha256": "027add3530c7c578ee77d1ceb2fc4b0a1beee1a157cca712e3193e4c7194c878", "ja": "お疲れさま。まあ、ここは仕事場だし、\n昼寝の邪魔されても仕方ないんじゃないかな……。", "zh": "辛苦了。不过，这里毕竟是工作的地方，\n睡午觉被打扰也是没办法的事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_003_1005_p", "source_sha256": "6e873eae69734149eba7da41ba6279cb9db78fa1f6fe7c5d2ddf5a9816a79bd3", "ja": "それに、俺は翼に仕事の話をしに来たんだ。", "zh": "还有，我是来和翼谈关于工作的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_003_1006_016tsu", "source_sha256": "83d5fdd8f332ab0504ac76877a7fb749d5bdf8ebd5f8ed1f1416c0a6479d8238", "ja": "はーい！　なになに？", "zh": "好──！什么什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_003_1007_p", "source_sha256": "5acf32c6a8534a43a895212a2d9d7161dd95dec498917de93420ba9fd710797d", "ja": "今度の公演だけど、\nセンターは翼にやってもらうことになった。", "zh": "下次的公演，\n决定让翼来担任Center。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_003_1008_016tsu", "source_sha256": "2daf4234496ed830043b1638799b3af0e6dbeb43a9d623252c59449cd9381037", "ja": "へっ？\nセンター？", "zh": "咦？\nCenter？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_003_1009_p", "source_sha256": "a57e01c07d912cd5b49c3cc418e49a18e1d75e378ce3bd9a571ef87f424bd600", "ja": "ああ、頼んだぞ。\n本番まで、しっかりレッスンしないとな。", "zh": "是啊，交给你了。\n到正式上场前，得好好练习才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_003_1010_016tsu", "source_sha256": "a8fd2ed9aaaaa604c6feb37d55899fca38c3fb2f4908f9faa34bf21fae75475b", "ja": "……え～？", "zh": "……咦～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_003_1011_p", "source_sha256": "b826364c88472057bd3ad4d8500d1fdccaec8d886065c518aedf593d42a35a2f", "ja": "なんだ、その声は……。\nこの前は、センターやりたいって言ってたじゃないか。", "zh": "怎么发出那种声音……\n你之前不是说很想当Center吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_003_1012_016tsu", "source_sha256": "5c0cc83e2ce7dbf0834b6d9ad2dd20152e076fd825ef5326300886ad17843550", "ja": "そんなの、この前はこの前、今は今、ですよ～。\nレッスンめんどくさい……。", "zh": "那种事情，之前是之前，现在是现在啊～\n练习好麻烦喔……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_003_1014_p", "source_sha256": "7e15ec38dc4c089209cf2a287731d100cfe0e1f3d64ac1dde18c318b70924263", "ja": "はいはい。\nとにかく、ちゃんとレッスンに出るんだぞ。", "zh": "好好好。\n总之要乖乖去练习喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_003_1015_016tsu", "source_sha256": "777bc24d36323dbf1d28bf29d9f41700fbef01167e1c695e65cb1a402a775c58", "ja": "はぁ～い。", "zh": "好～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_003_1016_p", "source_sha256": "de2be74e5a6d7c0888ddad4410f543c4efba02f3e745556bc6ff10d71909e4d2", "ja": "（やれやれ。翼は、才能はあるんだけど……\nその気にさせるのに、いつも苦労するな）", "zh": "（真伤脑筋，翼是很有天分……\n但每次都得费尽心思，才能让她提起干劲。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_003_1017_p", "source_sha256": "d22d6f5a594372a7a1ad7b1ebb3fd056d467e270afe341f41157d8af8689a240", "ja": "（でも、未来や静香とはまったく違った\n魅力のあるステージになるだろう。楽しみだ！）", "zh": "（不过，翼应该会呈现出和未来、静香\n有着不同魅力的表演吧。真令人期待！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
